    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#183;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is",
